Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.71,0:00:49.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.05,0:01:43.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,《谍影重重》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.11,0:01:57.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真是一团乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.78,0:02:00.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你以前从来没有看过死人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've never seen a dead man before?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.12,0:02:10.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿张毯子盖着他 把他盖起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put a blanket on him. Cover him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:11.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.50,0:02:13.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.55,0:02:16.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 我马上到 给他盖上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One minute. I'll be right there. Cover him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.15,0:04:37.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,苏黎世戈曼萨银行 000-7-17-12-0-14-26\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}000-7-17-12-0-14-26 Gemeinschaft Bank Zurich
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.46,0:04:56.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你他妈的对我做了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.17,0:05:01.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.84,0:05:03.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的! 我在哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn it! Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.51,0:05:07.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一艘渔船! 你当时在水里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A boat! A fishing boat. You were in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.14,0:05:08.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,被捞上船的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We pulled you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:09.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么水里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What water?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.93,0:05:12.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你中弹了 看见了吗? 这是子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were shot. See? There are the bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.66,0:05:18.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听好 有个银行帐号 为什么它在你的屁股里面?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, there is a number for a bank. Why was it in your hip?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.83,0:05:19.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的屁股?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My hip?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.79,0:05:21.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为什么在你的屁股里面? - 我的屁股\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why was it in your hip? - My hip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.62,0:05:23.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 在你屁股皮肤下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, in your hip under the skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.50,0:05:24.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.96,0:05:27.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你要把我怎样? - 你需要休息 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing with me? - You need to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.00,0:05:29.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请躺下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. Lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.09,0:05:32.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有恶意 我是你的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a friend. I'm your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.01,0:05:36.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫姜卡洛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Giancarlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.55,0:05:38.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.18,0:05:40.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.48,0:05:43.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.48,0:05:45.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.86,0:05:48.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 噢 天哪 - 躺下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, God. - Lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.53,0:05:56.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,弗吉尼亚州 兰利 中央情报局总部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}CENTRAL INTELLIGENCE AGENCY LANGLEY, VIRGINIA
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.01,0:06:18.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官 已得到确认 任务失败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been confirmed, sir. Mission failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.31,0:07:05.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我是谁吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.73,0:07:09.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:17.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我 我是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.20,0:07:20.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果知道我是谁...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you know who I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.87,0:07:24.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就请不要胡闹了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please stop messing around...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.95,0:07:26.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,赶快告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:40.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想吃的话就请过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want to eat, get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.59,0:07:44.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从这些海图来看 我可能去过离海岸更近的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Based on these charts, I think I may have been closer to the coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.43,0:07:47.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么? 你系的这些结?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this? You tie these knots?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.52,0:07:50.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 开始恢复记忆了? - 不 还没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So, it starts to come back? - No, it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.85,0:07:53.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这绳结没什么特别 我只是打个结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The knot's like everything else. I found the rope and I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.09,0:07:55.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像我能阅读\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same way I can read.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.61,0:07:58.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我能写字 做算术 煮咖啡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can write. I can add, subtract. I can make coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:08:02.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 洗扑克牌 摆棋盘 - 你的记忆肯定能恢复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can shuffle cards, play chess. - Yes, it will come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.12,0:08:05.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 恢复不了 真见鬼! 问题就出在这!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's not coming back, goddamn it! That's the point!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.99,0:08:08.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在这儿查看这些...鬼东西!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm down here looking through this, all this shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.66,0:08:10.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已在这呆了两星期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For two weeks I'm down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.67,0:08:13.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不顶用 我甚至不知道要查找什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not working. I don't even know what to look for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:20.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你需要休息 记忆会恢复的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to rest. It will come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.18,0:08:23.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要不恢复怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if it doesn't come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.85,0:08:29.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明天就到港口了 我却连名字都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We get in there tomorrow, I don't even have a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.01,0:09:03.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不多 但应该够你去瑞士了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not much, but it should get you to Switzerland.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.43,0:09:08.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.82,0:10:50.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不认识这些标识吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't you read the signs?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.78,0:10:52.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,站起来...快点 马上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On your feet...let's go...right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.79,0:10:56.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,公园关门了 不许在公园过夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The park is cIosed. There's no sleeping in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.58,0:10:58.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.50,0:11:00.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看一下你的证件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see some identification.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.13,0:11:02.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.38,0:11:03.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快拿证件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on...your papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.88,0:11:05.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么证件也没有 我失去...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have any papers. I lost my....
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.88,0:11:08.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我失去它们了...我的证件 都丢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've lost them...my papers...they are lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.05,0:11:13.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 跟我们走 举起手来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ok...let's go...put your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.89,0:11:16.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想睡...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I just need to sleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.40,0:11:42.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些人威胁我的家人 我的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These people have threatened my family. My babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.54,0:11:45.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以听好了 一旦证据齐全...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'm telling you, when the evidence is clear...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.00,0:11:47.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就有好戏让大家看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I will have a nice story for you to read about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.67,0:11:50.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有我那边的朋友 你们会看到好戏的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all my friends out there, you will read about yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.05,0:11:52.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为在我变得理智后...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want to play this game...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.88,0:11:56.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们若还想玩这场游戏 我就演给你们看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...after I have been reasonable, I will show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.35,0:12:00.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是尼瓦纳·翁博希前天在巴黎的讲话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Nykwana Wombosi speaking in Paris the day before yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.22,0:12:02.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他掌权前就是个刺头 执政时则是个麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was an irritation before he took power, a probIem...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.10,0:12:06.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,流亡后已成为我们的灾难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...when he was in power, and he's been a disaster for us in exile.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.81,0:12:09.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在写书 讲中情局在非洲的行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's writing a book about the Agency's history in Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.44,0:12:10.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他要点特工的名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's going to name names.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.98,0:12:14.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这简直是敲诈 他在强求中情局的援助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's basically a shaedown. He's demanding the Agency's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.28,0:12:18.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他想让我们在六个月内扶他重新上台 否则就等着瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants us to put him back in power in six months, or else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.12,0:12:21.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会把这次采访的磁带给需要者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This interview, and I'll make the tape availabIe to whoever wants it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.66,0:12:25.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在采访时还称自己刚躲过暗杀企图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he goes on to claim that he's just survived an assassination attempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:28.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说是我们干的 称自己有证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says it's us. He says he's got proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.92,0:12:32.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,局长想知道这一指控...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Director wants to know if there's any truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.80,0:12:34.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可有真实之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in this accusation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.05,0:12:38.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已向他保证我的高级幕僚中没人会这么鲁莽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've already assured him there's nobody that recless on my senior staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.77,0:12:48.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想起了我们以前的一次谈话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was recalling a conversation we had some time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.94,0:12:50.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,关于"踩石"行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taling about Treadstone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.77,0:12:54.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我似乎记得谈话中提到过翁博希的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I seem to remember Wombosi's name might have come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.90,0:12:57.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢肯定我们谈了些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure what we're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.86,0:12:59.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人试图把他干掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone tried to take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.58,0:13:02.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但却失手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tried and failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.54,0:13:05.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是踩石行动?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was this Treadstone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:08.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在直截了当地提问?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're asking me a direct question?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.29,0:13:10.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.04,0:13:13.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你不会这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you were never gonna do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.09,0:13:14.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.76,0:13:21.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们与我们的人失去了联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we lost the communication with our man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.01,0:13:22.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这几乎是两周前的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was almost two weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.97,0:13:25.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们整个小组没日没夜一直在干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've worked around the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.56,0:13:28.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们睡在那儿 想方设法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been sleeping down there. We're doing everything we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.94,0:13:33.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 但你不想让我知道这事? - 你以前从不想知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And you don't let me know this? - You never wanted to before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.23,0:13:35.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你以前从没失过手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never made a mistake before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.74,0:13:47.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞士苏黎世 戈曼萨银行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}GEMEINSCHAFT BANK ZURICH SWITZERLAND
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.89,0:14:08.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我能为你效劳吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.06,0:14:12.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我来办理保险箱帐户的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I'm here about a numbered account.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.52,0:14:15.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你把帐号填在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you just enter your account number here,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.54,0:14:17.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就叫人帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll direct you to an appropriate officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.97,0:16:06.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,美利坚合众国护照\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}PASSPORT United States of America
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.11,0:16:21.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫杰森·伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.32,0:16:28.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,住在巴黎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I live in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.42,0:18:05.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在想...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to think...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.09,0:18:07.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,离我上次来这里有多久了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long's it been since I was here last?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.55,0:18:09.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢肯定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.30,0:18:11.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定有三星期了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must be three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.94,0:18:27.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 是巴黎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.57,0:18:30.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有杰森·伯恩的电话号码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have the number for a Jason Bourne?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.74,0:18:34.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有的 先生 需要给你接通吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Would you lie me to connect you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.24,0:18:35.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请接通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.12,0:18:43.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是46990384\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is 46990384.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.75,0:18:45.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请在听到信号声后留言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave a message at the beep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.52,0:19:47.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,美国公民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}U.S. Citizens
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.94,0:19:52.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是美国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm an American.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.20,0:19:53.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.95,0:19:55.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.24,0:19:57.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在这没有管辖权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've no jurisdiction here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.16,0:19:59.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,站在外边 明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it there. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.92,0:20:05.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.08,0:20:07.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 这不是我现在住址 明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. No. This is not my current address, oay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.71,0:20:11.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它在我两天前开始排队时还是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was my address until two days ago, when I started standing in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.67,0:20:13.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在已没有公寓了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I lose my apartment, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.05,0:20:16.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这意味着没有住址 电话 钱 时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means no address, no phone, no money, no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.97,0:20:19.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 而我还没拿到签证? - 库鲁茨小姐 请冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And I still have no visa! - Miss Kreutz, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.43,0:20:21.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须请你放低声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must ask you to keep your voice down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.56,0:20:24.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 但上周与我谈话的那家伙在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. But where's the guy that I talked to last week?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.90,0:20:27.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每周都换新人 凭什么要我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every week it's a new person. How am I supposed to...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.44,0:20:29.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你上周见的是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know who you saw last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.27,0:20:32.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好 我帮你找 确信有他名字 - 请稍等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let me help you. I'm sure I have it. - Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.03,0:20:34.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能听我说吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could I have your attention for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.24,0:20:36.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿找到了 你看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have it right here. Just look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.53,0:20:40.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在费尽心思地躲避美国的移民法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You staged an effort to circumvent the immigration Iaws of the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.37,0:20:42.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,目前这是学生签证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a student visa now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.96,0:20:45.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这已和绿卡无关 完全不是一回事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not about a green card anymore. It's very different.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.17,0:20:50.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 库鲁茨小姐 这不是菜单 你不... - 我把所有证明都带来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's not a menu. You don't just.... - I brought all this proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.25,0:20:51.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,疑犯...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Potential suspect....
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.63,0:20:54.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是袭击案的同案犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help in assauIt incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.55,0:21:00.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,红口袋! 拿红口袋那个人!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You! Red bag! The red bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.76,0:21:03.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,站在原地不动! 举起手来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop right there! Put your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.81,0:21:43.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我正赶过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.98,0:21:52.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点! 快! 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it! Now! Now! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.99,0:21:58.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一队从后面楼梯往上冲 二队...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alpha Unit, tae the bac stairs and wor your way up. Bravo...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.16,0:22:05.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,疏散方案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}EVACUATION PLAN
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.87,0:22:08.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上! 快上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move in! Move in!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.85,0:22:12.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 没人!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.67,0:22:13.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,疑犯是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suspect is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.88,0:22:17.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,二队正在上楼 即将到达二楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moving up staircase. Proceeding to second floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.01,0:22:23.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一队 你们可以上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alpha Unit, you're clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.52,0:22:33.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快! 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.69,0:22:37.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一队 二队 目标也许有对讲机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All Units, target may have a radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.32,0:22:39.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用代码77 通话结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to Code 77. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.53,0:22:41.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,代码77 收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Code 77, copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.70,0:22:43.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,趴在地板上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The floor! Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.99,0:22:46.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没人!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.54,0:22:47.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,危险 请勿打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}DANGER DO NOT OPEN
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.89,0:23:07.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请勿进入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}DO NOT ENTER
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.21,0:24:12.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快 往前挪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go. Move up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.69,0:25:21.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他现在在苏黎世? 现在? - 是的 刚收到消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's in Zurich now? Right now? - Yes. It just came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.18,0:25:25.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们确信是他吗? - 是的 他去了银行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're sure it's him? - Yes. He went to the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.49,0:25:27.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我们在银行的线人汇报的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our source at the bank, that's who called.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.45,0:25:28.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.37,0:25:30.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他肯定会想到我们在监视银行 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's got to assume we're watching the bank, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.87,0:25:33.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 快开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.12,0:25:36.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说他清空保险箱却留下枪 是何意?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, he cleaned out the box. He left a gun. What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.67,0:25:38.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过 我不知道!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.38,0:25:40.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我更喜欢认为他已死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I Iiked it better when I thought he was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.14,0:25:59.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看什么呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.48,0:26:01.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在里面听你说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard you inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.06,0:26:02.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.02,0:26:05.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我听到了你在领事馆说的话 我想我们或许可以相互帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The consulate. I heard you talking. I thought maybe we could help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.82,0:26:07.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么帮?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.20,0:26:09.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你需要钱 我需要坐车离开这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need money. I need a ride out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.91,0:26:12.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 我不提供租车业务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not running a car service. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.91,0:26:16.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你一万美元开车送我去巴黎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll give you $10, 000 to drive me to Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.21,0:26:19.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 你以为我是傻子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, do you think I'm a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.17,0:26:21.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不干就是傻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd be a fool not to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.92,0:26:28.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是开玩笑? 还是什么骗局? - 这不是骗局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is this a joke? Some kind of scam? - No, it's no scam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.59,0:26:31.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到后我会另付你一万美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll give you another $10, 000 when we arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.72,0:26:32.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.27,0:26:43.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是抓你的吗? - 听好 你开车我付钱 就这么简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that for you? - Look. You drive, I pay. It's that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.44,0:26:49.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我麻烦已够多的了 明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got enough troubIe, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.11,0:26:51.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.11,0:26:53.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以要回钱吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I have my money back?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.59,0:27:10.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 继续往下放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, go. Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.39,0:27:12.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.10,0:27:15.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就这! 等等? - 不 应该是快结束的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There! Wait! - No, it's got to be near the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.56,0:27:18.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,弟兄们 我们撞大运了! 开始干吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, folks! We caught a break here! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.64,0:27:19.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我这有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I'm up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.89,0:27:22.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找到坐标了 飞机 火车 宾馆 医院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're getting grids. Airline, train, hotels, hospitals.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.98,0:27:25.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁查到了地址? 街道名? 戈门萨德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's getting the address? The street? Gemensheidt.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.57,0:27:27.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 看好了 - 我找到了 我想我找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here we go. - I think I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.82,0:27:29.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是他吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it him?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.40,0:27:30.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是实时的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unreal.
