Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.49,0:27:36.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,苏黎世警方正搜查一个拿红口袋的美国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zurich police are looking for an American carrying a red bank bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.29,0:27:40.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他刚大闹了使馆 昨晚还把两名警察"送进"了医院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just tore up the embassy and put two cops in the hospital last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.67,0:27:45.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把所有人都激活 马上 我要他们都行动起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get everybody up. Do it now. I want them all activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.92,0:27:47.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 激活所有人? 同时?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. All of them? At the same time?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.80,0:27:51.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 我要伯恩在日落前躺在尸体袋里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard me. I want Bourne in a body bag by sundown.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.51,0:27:55.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 在这贴张地图! 快点 弟兄们! 我们来安排好这些!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's get a map up here! Come on, folks! Let's work it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.18,0:27:59.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,口令:XX9897 待命外派特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}PASSWORD: XX9897 AVAILABLE AGENTS IN LOCATION
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.52,0:28:01.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坐标正在更新\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The grids are getting updated.
