Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.39,0:29:20.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这对我来说没什么 因为我已有准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...which was fine with me because I was ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.76,0:29:23.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,即便在阿姆斯特丹呆六个月也不确信...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After six months in Amsterdam, you're not sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.43,0:29:26.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是在那呆了20分钟还是20年 你知道我的意思吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if you've been there 20 minutes or years, you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.65,0:29:29.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因此我带着钱离开那 加入朋友一起...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I went. I took all the money I had. I went in with friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.11,0:29:33.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,接手了法国比亚里兹郊外的 一个很棒的冲浪商店\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we took over this really cool surf shop outside Biarritz,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.82,0:29:34.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它紧挨着海边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}right by the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.79,0:29:36.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那简直太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.78,0:29:40.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那三个月实在是太好了 直到后来发现...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was just amazing for about three months, until it turned out that this...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.95,0:29:45.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把商店预租给我们的那个蠢蛋实际上骗了我们 而且...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...jerk who had fronted us the lease was actually shining everyone on and....
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.21,0:29:53.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.30,0:29:57.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"怎样"是什么意思? 你听好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean ''what''? Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.30,0:29:59.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直不停地说了快60公里的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been speed-talking for about 60 kilometers now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.97,0:30:03.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一紧张就要说...我说这些是因为我紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I talk when I'm nervous. I mean, I talk like this when I'm nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.31,0:30:05.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我要闭嘴不说了 - 别那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm gonna shut up now. - No, don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.14,0:30:10.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已有段时间没和人说话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't talked to anybody in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.90,0:30:13.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 但我们没有说话 就我在说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but we're not talking. I'm talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.73,0:30:16.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,自离开苏黎世后 你说了有十个字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've said, like, 10 words since we left Zurich.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.65,0:30:19.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 听你说是一种休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, listening to you, it's relaxing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.83,0:30:24.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有一阵没睡觉了 而且...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't slept in a while and....
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.08,0:30:27.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且还遇上这头疼的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I've had this headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.29,0:30:29.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像在脑子里不停地运转...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like a constant thing in my head...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.50,0:30:32.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且刚开始触及背景...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and it's just starting to move to the background...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.84,0:30:34.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因此接着说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.71,0:30:38.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真的 如果你愿意 就请便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really, if you want, please keep talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.84,0:30:42.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.06,0:30:45.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢什么样的音乐?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of music do you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.69,0:30:50.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢什么样的? 说啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you like? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.86,0:30:54.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 还是算了吧 - 不 告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know what? Never mind. - No, it's fine. Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.65,0:30:56.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想听什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want to listen to?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.03,0:30:58.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.03,0:31:02.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,得了 这没什么好难的 你喜欢什么? 告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, it's not that hard. What do you like? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.83,0:31:04.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.75,0:31:17.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁会付两万美元坐车去巴黎?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who pays $20, 000 for a ride to Paris?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.56,0:31:28.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.73,0:31:33.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两周前发生的事 我什么也记不起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't remember anything that happened before two weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.57,0:31:36.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 真幸运 - 不 我是说真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lucky you. - No, I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.90,0:31:40.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我是谁 我不知道我要去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know who I am. I don't know where I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.78,0:31:42.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,全不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.24,0:31:45.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是吗? 像健忘症? - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? Like amnesia? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.41,0:31:49.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 健忘症 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Amnesia. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.25,0:31:54.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.59,0:32:05.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是观察该庭院的最好角度? - 是唯一角度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And that's the best angle of the courtyard? - That's the only angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.47,0:32:08.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在这些街道或这一地区有什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do they have of the streets? Or, you know, the area?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.60,0:32:09.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定有东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must have something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.93,0:32:11.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.48,0:32:15.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.61,0:32:20.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玩游戏? 警告我们? 威胁我们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it a game? Is he warning us? Is it a threat?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.65,0:32:22.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官 看这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir? Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.45,0:32:27.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是哪? - 某个角度观察到的那条街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's that? - It's an angle of the street, a sort of alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.49,0:32:29.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,增强信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just enhance it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.58,0:32:36.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个人是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, who the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.46,0:32:39.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽·库鲁茨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marie Helena Kreutz.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.30,0:32:43.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,26岁 出生在汉诺威 她父亲是焊接工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's 26, born outside Hanover. Her father was a welder.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.59,0:32:45.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,死于87年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He died in '87.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.14,0:32:48.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还没她母亲的资料 她祖母仍住在汉诺威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We still don't have the mother. The grandmother, she's still in Hanover.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.97,0:32:52.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看来她成了这场家庭小灾难中的依靠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks like she's the anchor for this little domestic disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.60,0:32:54.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有个同母异父的弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's a stepbrother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.27,0:32:56.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦的是 她是"吉普赛人"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's tough. The girl's a gypsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.36,0:33:01.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是指她四处出现 但充其量也就是乱跑而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, she pops up on the grid here and there, but it's chaotic at best.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.03,0:33:03.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,95年时 她在西班牙付过电费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She paid some electric bilIs in Spain, '95.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.53,0:33:06.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,96年在比利时 有三个月用自己的名字作户主安装过电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had a phone in her name for three months in Belgium, '96.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.12,0:33:09.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有纳税和贷款记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No taxes, no credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.62,0:33:12.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢这人 我要你们深入调查她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like her. I want to go deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.04,0:33:15.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,查她祖母和那半个弟弟的电话记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get a phone log for Granny and the half-brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.96,0:33:18.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,查与她有关的任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody we can cross-file.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.17,0:33:21.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要知道她过去六年都呆过哪些地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to now every place she's slept in the past six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.46,0:33:25.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,叫巴黎方面把这些印出来给外勤人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have Paris get these out in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.30,0:33:29.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,法国巴黎 踩石行动密点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}TREADSTONE SAFE HOUSE PARIS, FRANCE
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.04,0:33:55.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有编故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not maing this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.33,0:33:57.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.92,0:34:06.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.05,0:34:08.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁的银行保险箱里会装满了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who has a safety deposit box full of...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.26,0:34:13.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,钱 六本护照 还有一把枪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...money and six passports and a gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.06,0:34:19.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁会把银行帐号藏在屁股?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who has a bank account number in their hip?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.27,0:34:24.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我进来后做的第一件事 就是全面观察...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I come in here, and the first thing I'm doing is I'm catching the sightlines...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.57,0:34:25.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,寻找出口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and looking for an exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.90,0:34:28.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也看见出口标志了 但我不担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see the exit sign, too. I'm not worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.11,0:34:30.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说你遭枪击了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, you were shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.91,0:34:34.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人在惊吓状态下会做出反常的事来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People do all inds of weird and amazing stuff when they are scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.08,0:34:44.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以告诉你...门外六辆车的牌号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can tell you the license plate numbers of all six cars outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.92,0:34:47.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以告诉你...女服务员是左撇子...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that our waitress is left-handed...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.55,0:34:51.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有坐在柜台边那小子重98公斤 他还没喝多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and the guy sitting at the counter weighs 215 pounds and can handle himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.93,0:34:55.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道要想找枪的最佳地点...是那辆灰色卡车的驾驶室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I now the best place to loo for a gun is the cab of the gray truc outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.77,0:34:57.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在目前的海拔高度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At this altitude,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.45,0:35:00.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以全速跑上八百米而手不发抖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can run flat out for a half-mile before my hands start shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.27,0:35:05.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么会知道这些?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now why would I know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.82,0:35:11.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎能知道这些 却不知自己是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can I know that and not know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.86,0:35:46.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,巴黎103 里尔350\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}PARIS 103 LILLE 350
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.82,0:35:53.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.45,0:35:57.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我睡着了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I slept.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.04,0:36:02.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 简直不敢相信 - 你太困了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't believe it. - Yeah, well, you were tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.54,0:36:03.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直没睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't slept.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.00,0:36:07.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 到了 为两万美元的缘故 我免费赠送早餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, here. For $20, 000, I like to throw in breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.30,0:36:11.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你停车加过油吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you stop for gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.01,0:36:16.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你睡得跟死猪一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were pretty out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.02,0:36:24.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为这儿有家人在等着你?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, do you think there's, Iike, a family waiting for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.65,0:36:27.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.69,0:36:31.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想过这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.29,0:36:41.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是这吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.21,0:36:43.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,104号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}104.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.12,0:36:45.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 地址是这 别停 继续开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's the address. No, keep going. Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.00,0:36:49.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好的 怎么走? - 左拐 停这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. Where? - Just take a left. Pull in over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.92,0:36:51.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.60,0:37:07.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 是这里了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, this is it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.56,0:37:09.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.11,0:37:13.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 这里我一点也认不出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, I don't recognize any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.90,0:37:15.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我该走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.95,0:37:21.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰森?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jason?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.54,0:37:26.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 钱 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God. The money. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.96,0:37:28.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.92,0:37:30.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.42,0:37:32.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.97,0:37:34.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你开车送我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for the ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.43,0:37:36.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,随时恭候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.14,0:37:46.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以一块上去 或在这等我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you could come up. I mean, or you can wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.06,0:37:49.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我去查查 你在这等 - 哦...不用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can go check it out. But you could wait. - Oh, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.65,0:37:51.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.44,0:37:55.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这等的话 你很可能会把我忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With you, you would probably just forget about me if I stayed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.07,0:37:59.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么可能忘了你?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could I forget about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.16,0:38:03.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我唯一认识的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the only person I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.29,0:38:09.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那倒是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.68,0:38:26.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你不在家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess you're not home.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.53,0:38:37.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伯恩先生 你回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monsieur Bourne, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.61,0:38:42.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伯恩先生 我还在想...好久没见你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monsieur Bourne, I was wondering... I haven't seen you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.20,0:38:44.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.66,0:38:47.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我忘带钥匙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I forgot my key.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.97,0:39:04.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.44,0:39:25.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你确信这些全是你的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure this is all yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.87,0:39:28.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.09,0:39:51.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的厨房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.96,0:40:11.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有线索吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any clues?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.96,0:40:14.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我是干航运的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I'm in the shipping business.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.59,0:40:16.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你开始回忆起来了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it's all coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.63,0:40:25.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以用一下卫生间吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you mind if I use the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.93,0:40:28.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.97,0:40:30.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.13,0:40:56.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂? 喂?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Hello? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.79,0:41:00.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先生 巴黎女王饭店 请问转哪个分机?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir, Hotel Regina, Paris. How may I direct your call?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.34,0:41:02.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你们是在巴黎? - 是的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, you're in Paris? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.63,0:41:06.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要找你们饭店的一位客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm looking for a guest there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.14,0:41:08.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他叫杰森·伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Jason Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.06,0:41:10.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 请稍候 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One moment, please. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.65,0:41:18.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先生 很抱歉 没有人以该名字入住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid I have no one by that name registered.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.07,0:41:22.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.86,0:41:25.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等! 别挂! 喂?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! No, no. Are you there? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.24,0:41:26.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.11,0:41:29.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,能帮我查另外一个人名吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you check another name for me, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.49,0:41:31.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请稍等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, bear with me one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.58,0:41:39.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰·凯恩 凯旋的凯 请稍候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John Kane. Kane with a ''K.'' One moment, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.21,0:41:40.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.89,0:41:51.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是找凯恩先生? 约翰·凯恩?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You call about Monsieur Kane? John Michael Kane?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.18,0:41:53.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.89,0:41:57.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是他的朋友? - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You are a friend of his? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.52,0:42:00.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先生 我要告诉你个坏消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have some very bad news for you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.90,0:42:02.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry to tell you this,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.97,0:42:06.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,凯恩先生大约两周前去世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but Monsieur Kane has passed away almost two weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.86,0:42:09.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他发生了意外 是在高速公路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was an accident. On the motorway.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.70,0:42:12.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他显然当场就死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently, he was illed instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.20,0:42:15.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真的很抱歉 告诉你这消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really, I'm terribly sorry to be the one to tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.87,0:42:20.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吧 我们是在他们来收拾...他的东西时 得知此事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When they came for his things, it was made nown for us, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.75,0:42:22.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who came?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.21,0:42:23.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.13,0:42:28.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他兄弟留下电话号码或联系方式了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did his brother leave a number or a way to get in touch with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.09,0:42:29.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think not.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.72,0:42:32.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.16,0:42:57.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰森? 没有热水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jason? There's no hot water.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.79,0:42:59.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,水冰凉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.29,0:43:02.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我去试试厨房里的水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go try the water in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.63,0:43:06.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要不就呆在卫生间? 我去看看能否把水放热\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you just stay in the bathroom? I'll see if I can get it hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.26,0:43:13.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里的水也冰凉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's really cold in here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.94,0:43:25.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,水还是凉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The water is still cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.99,0:43:31.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 厨房里的也是 尽管我已放水了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's cold in the kitchen, too. I got it running, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.29,0:43:36.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So....
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.38,0:43:44.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.13,0:43:47.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.97,0:43:51.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.55,0:43:53.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.98,0:44:08.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.65,0:44:11.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.40,0:44:49.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰森!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jason!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.42,0:45:53.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把它打开 告诉我里面是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open that. Tell me what's inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.97,0:45:55.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.01,0:45:58.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.31,0:46:01.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.23,0:46:04.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有武器 且危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ARMED AND DANGEROUS
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.60,0:46:06.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.15,0:46:10.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.73,0:46:12.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快回答! 你是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Answer me! Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.99,0:46:15.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他有我的照片? - 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's got my picture! - All right. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.57,0:46:17.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是苏黎世 是昨天的? - 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is Zurich, yesterday! - Don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.95,0:46:19.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白你从哪弄的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Where did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.70,0:46:22.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,站住 你是怎么拿到照片的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay there. How did you get my picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.37,0:46:24.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你从哪弄来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you get this from?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.62,0:46:26.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么弄来我的...我的天!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you get my.... My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.62,0:46:30.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我来处理! 你呆在原地 呆在那!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do this! You stay there. Stay there!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.98,0:46:50.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你的鞋在哪? 把鞋穿上 - 好的 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are your shoes? Get your shoes. - Sure. Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.23,0:46:53.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他跳下窗户了 为何会有人这样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He went out the window. Why would someone do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.90,0:46:56.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能呆这了 这不安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't stay here. It's not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.40,0:47:00.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以逃出去 但必须马上走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can get us out of here, but we got to go. We got to go right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.04,0:47:05.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你可以留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, look, you can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.58,0:47:08.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以留下等警察来 不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can wait for the cops. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.17,0:47:11.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你等他们来就是了 但我不能 我必须离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just wait for them to get here. But I can't. I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.59,0:47:14.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.01,0:47:19.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.68,0:47:28.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别吭声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quiet. Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.05,0:47:40.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.92,0:47:55.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请报代号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Code in.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.88,0:47:58.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿尔法 37509\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alpha 37509.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.76,0:48:01.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.89,0:48:08.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,稍等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.73,0:48:11.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是伯恩 他去巴黎了 去了公寓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne went to Paris, to the apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.10,0:48:14.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 抓到他了? 说 - 他杀了我们的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We got him? Tell me. - He killed our man.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.82,0:48:16.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么? 在公寓里? - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? In the apartment? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.98,0:48:20.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你必须把这事摆平 - 不行 我没法摆平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, you got to clean that up. - No, I can't clean it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.49,0:48:22.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 尸体在街上 - 那又怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's a body in the street. - So?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.57,0:48:24.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,街上有警察 这是巴黎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's police. This is Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.45,0:48:27.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,监听警方通讯 尽可能地截获信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put up the scanners. Get as much radio information as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.41,0:48:32.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你呆在车里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, you stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.50,0:48:35.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我去找地方把钱存上 十分钟后回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna go find a place for this money. I'll be back in 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.75,0:50:02.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 我告诉过你呆在车里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I told you to stay in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.89,0:50:10.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天 我叫你呆在车里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ. I told you to stay in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.39,0:50:14.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我去喝了点东西 我以为你不回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I needed a drink. I didn't think you would come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.19,0:50:17.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你必须去报警\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, you got to go to the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.06,0:50:19.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马上去 赶在事情变得更糟以前去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now. You got to go before this gets any worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.52,0:50:21.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就我自己? - 不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- By myself? - It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.40,0:50:24.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你把我的护照带上 给警察看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna take my passport, okay? You show this to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.40,0:50:26.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有那张照片 还有这两万美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have that picture, you have the $20, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.74,0:50:29.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把所有事都告诉警察 他们会相信的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tell them everything that happened. They'll believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.66,0:50:31.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们只能相信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have to believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.58,0:50:38.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽 你不能只是坐在这里 这不安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marie, you can't just sit here. It's not safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.50,0:50:40.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,安全? 这一切都起始于使馆里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Safe? This is from inside the embassy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.67,0:50:43.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谁能干这些事? - 我不知道 - 从昨天起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who can do this? - I don't know. - This is from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.51,0:50:47.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们怎能知道我们在一起? - 我这么做 是为你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How can they know we're together? - I'm trying to do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.55,0:50:49.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就这么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.47,0:50:52.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为我好? 你把我独自交给警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'll you make this right by sending me there alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.14,0:50:54.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能为我好?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I want you to go to the cops? That's good?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.64,0:50:56.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想去 那好 你去我就得逃!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to go, fine. If you go, I run!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.69,0:50:59.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你去说清情况? - 我不清楚到底怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You tell them what happened! - I don't know what happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.56,0:51:01.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知那家伙是谁 以及照片的来历\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know who this guy was or about that picture!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.98,0:51:03.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知我是谁!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know who I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.57,0:51:11.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm....
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.74,0:51:14.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你表现得就像是我要害你 我是怕做错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I'm trying to burn you. I'm trying to do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.12,0:51:17.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没人能做对的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody does the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.34,0:51:28.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听好 我不能带着你逃亡 不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I can't run with you. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.68,0:51:33.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起就得像这么生活 我得...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We run, I got to live like this. I got to....
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.27,0:51:34.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至不知道我在躲谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't even know who I'm hiding from.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.14,0:51:37.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这帮人知道我是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These people know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.02,0:51:40.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须留在这里 我得查明真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I got to stay here. I got to figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.52,0:51:42.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就查明真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.50,0:52:02.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你来开车?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take care of this car?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.71,0:52:03.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.92,0:52:06.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在来的路上 我觉得车胎有点没气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The tires feIt a little splashy on the way over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.84,0:52:09.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,车开起来有点往右偏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It pulIs a little to the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.57,0:52:32.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是最后的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last chance, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.16,0:53:57.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So....
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.53,0:54:00.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么? - 我们就要颠簸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - We got a bump coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.61,0:54:36.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把头转开 把头转开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn your head away. Turn your head away.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.50,0:56:49.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们永远不能回这车上来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can never come back to this car.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.08,0:56:51.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.84,0:56:56.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 我们要把它擦干净 我来抹去指纹 然后我们离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we're gonna clean it out, and I'll wipe it down, and we walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.22,0:56:57.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就这样 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's it. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.93,0:57:01.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要找个地方供我们休息 而且 我得理清头绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. And I'll find a place for us to rest. And I got to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.76,0:57:04.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有帽子或头巾什么的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have a hat or a scarf or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.06,0:57:06.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 盖住我的头发? - 对 直到换发型\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For my hair? - Yeah. Just until we can change it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.68,0:57:08.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有 那当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Sure. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.56,0:57:09.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.27,0:57:13.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,法国巴黎 霍芬曼陈尸所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}HOFFENMEIn MORGUE PARlS, FRANCE
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.60,0:57:49.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.94,0:57:52.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这人没中弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This man was not shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.50,0:58:14.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有何消息?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.00,0:58:17.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,翁博希去了陈尸所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wombosi went to the morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.25,0:58:19.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他看了尸体 他不信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He saw the body. He didn't buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.18,0:58:22.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he now?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.84,0:58:25.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过我人手不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you, I'm not staffed for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.10,0:58:27.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在哪? 翁博希现在在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he? Right now! Where's Wombosi?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.47,0:58:28.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,刚离开陈尸所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were leaving the morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.85,0:58:30.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,刚走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They just left.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.44,0:58:39.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官 你看怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, what do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.71,1:00:40.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要拿瓶子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to get the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.92,1:02:13.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.26,1:02:25.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你已打扫了房间?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You already cleaned the room?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.35,1:02:29.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我把所有地方的指纹都擦去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wiped the whole place down for fingerprints.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.73,1:02:36.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以走动吗? 会留下脚印吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I walk around or is it gonna leave any footprints?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.62,1:02:46.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可以走 这没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can walk around. It's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.79,1:02:49.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过 我们要记住碰过哪些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we'll just keep track of everything we touch.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.54,1:02:52.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,离开房间时 不能留下任何痕迹 我想这样会更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's best if we leave a room, that we don't leave a trail.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.33,1:02:54.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为何? 我们去哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why? Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.92,1:02:57.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去约翰·凯恩住过的饭店\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to go to the hotel where John Michael Kane stayed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.76,1:02:59.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,女王饭店\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Hotel Regina.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.55,1:03:04.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我就是他 那他们就会有入住记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I was him, then they're gonna have some records.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.43,1:03:06.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要饭店的帐单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need that hotel bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.31,1:03:07.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.77,1:03:10.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过 这变得有点复杂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It gets slightly complicated, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.31,1:03:13.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.94,1:03:16.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.86,1:03:24.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 先生 求你别这样 - 他们想打仗 我们就给他们仗打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir, Please. - They want war, we'll make war.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.03,1:03:27.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们想杀我 最好一上来就把我杀掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they want to kill me, they better kill me the first time.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.62,1:03:31.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们最好把我杀死 最好在我睡觉时把我杀死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They better kill me dead. They better kill me when I'm in my sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.12,1:03:33.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说 尼瓦纳 我们需要这些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me. We need these people.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.58,1:03:36.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要找到能帮我们的人 本身就够难的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's hard enough getting people that we know to help us.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.34,1:03:37.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要谨慎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.84,1:03:38.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.59,1:03:40.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.71,1:03:43.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要把那混蛋小子的头给我带回来...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to bring me back that bastard kid's head...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.09,1:03:47.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放在这所房子前面 向他们展示我们从事的战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...put it in front of this house, and show them the war we're fighting.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.22,1:03:48.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但那正好...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that is precisely...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.86,1:03:58.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼瓦纳!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nykwana!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.74,1:04:10.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,动身前 我们要核对一下表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll give the watch a reference check before we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.95,1:04:13.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.46,1:04:17.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个公用电话的号码是多少?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the pay phone number?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.13,1:04:20.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,616-2468\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}616-2468.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.46,1:04:21.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出口呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exits?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.84,1:04:23.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有三个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's three.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.30,1:04:27.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,后面是内部人员出口 側面出口通向布满店铺的街道...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Service at the back, side goes to the street past the shops...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.85,1:04:29.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,前面的是最佳出口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...front is the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.76,1:04:31.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我认为我被人跟踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I think I'm being followed,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.66,1:04:33.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我出来时 就把包挎在右肩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I walk out with the bag over my right shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.73,1:04:35.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要是没出租车怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if there's no taxi?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.31,1:04:39.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就一直往前走 不要回头看 直到你和我联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I keep on walking, don't look back until you make contact.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.15,1:04:43.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.57,1:04:49.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们真需要这样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need this, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.20,1:04:53.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.05,1:05:06.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要离你远点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need distances.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.59,1:05:09.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你走进去选个位置 要靠近大堂中央\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You walk in, you pick a spot. Some midpoint in the lobby.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.47,1:05:12.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要数清并记住走到那个位置的步数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Count your steps to that spot, and then remember that number.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.06,1:05:15.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我给你打电话后 你要赶快行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because after I call you, I can get you moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.64,1:05:17.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.81,1:05:19.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还要数人数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I also need a head count.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.23,1:05:22.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你走到柜台这段时间 弄清有多少人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many people from when you walk in until you get to the desk.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.27,1:05:25.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那里有多少职员? 当然还有保安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many hotel employees are there? And obviously security.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.24,1:05:27.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过要认出他们 或许没那么容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it might not be that easy to see who they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.49,1:05:31.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会给你打电话 你告诉我那的布局 我们就从那开始干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'll call you, you give me the layout, and we'll take it from there.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.58,1:05:36.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,女王饭店\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hotel Regina.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.79,1:05:38.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请转大堂公用电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, the house phone in the lobby.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.52,1:05:59.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么了? - 我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened? - l...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.27,1:06:02.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 出差错了? - 我拿到了记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did something go wrong? - I've got the records.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.61,1:06:06.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,前台那个小伙当时朝我微笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He, this guy at the front desk was smiling at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.40,1:06:08.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因此想到所有那些麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I thought, you know, all this trouble,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.46,1:06:10.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许直接找他会更容易一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe it's easier to just ask for them.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.70,1:06:13.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你拿到了帐单? - 他给我复印了一份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You have the bill? - He made me a photocopy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.99,1:06:16.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你直接要的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just asked for it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.33,1:06:21.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说我是凯恩先生的私人助手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said I was Mr. Kane's personal assistant.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.17,1:06:28.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想得真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. That's good thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.77,1:06:39.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 长官 要我... - 不用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir, can l... - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.44,1:06:47.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,翁博希在他巴黎市中心的寓所被暗杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wombosi was assassinated in his house in the middle of Paris.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.11,1:06:50.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我们刚听说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we just heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.61,1:06:53.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是伯恩干的 我们几乎可以断定是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's him. It's Bourne. We're almost positive.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.87,1:06:56.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他被分派了任务 但却失手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had an assignment. He failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.24,1:06:59.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,显然 他觉得自己必须完成任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He obviously feIt compelled to finish the task.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.37,1:07:00.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.33,1:07:02.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们认为 他现在就会回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We think he'll come back in now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.79,1:07:04.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说程序如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, it's routine.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.54,1:07:06.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就像是行为软件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like behavioral software.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.13,1:07:10.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他会照章行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's following a protocol.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.55,1:07:14.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,既然他已完成任务 我们认为 他就会回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that he's completed the mission, we think he'll come back in.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.39,1:07:17.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们总是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They always do.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.81,1:07:19.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,何时回来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.22,1:07:21.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他回来报到还要多久?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long till he checks in?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.60,1:07:24.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 24小时 - 24小时?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 24 hours. - 24?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.65,1:07:26.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 通常要这么久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's usually something like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.07,1:07:29.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then what?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.65,1:07:32.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过 我们会把这事摆平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you we'd clean this up.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.91,1:07:34.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会摆平的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will be clean.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.04,1:07:42.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你是家潜水用品店 不过 你们店在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand you're a dive shop, but where are you located?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.83,1:07:45.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马赛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marseilles?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.86,1:08:12.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们公司具体提供些什么产品?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What specifically does your company supply?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.15,1:08:15.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 先生 你说你叫什么名字?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am sorry. What is your name, monsieur?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.37,1:08:26.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在这呆了三小时 却没找到一个指纹?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been here for three hours and you still can't find a print?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.43,1:08:38.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么事? - 巴黎警察找到车子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Paris police found the vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.44,1:08:55.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你已拨通联合保安公司海事部...西蒙·罗林斯的办公室电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've reached Simon Rawlins at Alliance Security, Maritime Division.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.07,1:08:59.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在巴黎的办公时间是早八点至下午五点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paris office hours are from 8.:00 a.m. to 5.:00 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.08,1:09:02.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在巴黎找到一个线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a lead in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.54,1:09:05.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有两个英国南安普敦的 其余都是马赛的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rest were Marseilles, and two out in Southampton.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.29,1:09:07.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有巴黎的? 是谁? - 联合保安公司 西蒙·罗林斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Paris? It's what? - Alliance Security. Simon Rawlins.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.92,1:09:09.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是留言电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a machine.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.53,1:09:36.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,凯恩先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Kane?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.78,1:09:39.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,凯恩先生!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Kane!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.57,1:09:43.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你好吗? - 我还可以 你呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How are you? - I'm good. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.41,1:09:50.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,凯恩先生 请进来 请坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Kane. Come right in. Please have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.58,1:09:52.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.38,1:09:55.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看 这是帕尔默三层甲板游艇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, this is the Palmer Johnson tri-deck.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.96,1:09:59.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你还是想买同一艘船?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm assuming you're still in the market. It's still the same vessel?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.68,1:10:01.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.70,1:10:26.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是凯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'm Kane.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.83,1:10:28.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚作为凯恩开了会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They... I had a meeting as Kane.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.71,1:10:30.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们说... - 我的确是凯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They said... - No. I'm definitely Kane.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.54,1:10:33.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚以凯恩身份见了个人 他也认为我是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just had a meeting as Kane and he knew me as Kane.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.38,1:10:36.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我的确是伯恩 也的确是凯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'm definitely Bourne. I'm also just definitely Kane.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.34,1:10:37.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,全跟船有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all just boats.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.71,1:10:39.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有设计图 摄像机和保安系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got blueprints and cameras and security systems.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.18,1:10:42.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚查到约翰·凯恩的尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just found John Michael Kane's body.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.39,1:10:45.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在巴黎这里的陈尸所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a morgue here in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.18,1:10:49.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果你是约翰·凯恩 那么那个尸体到底是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you are John Michael Kane, whose body do they have?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.90,1:11:00.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 再说一遍 什么名字? - 凯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What was the name again? - Kane.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.74,1:11:01.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,凯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kane.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.86,1:11:03.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰·凯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John Michael Kane.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.32,1:11:05.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,约翰·凯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John Michael Kane.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.21,1:11:12.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,凯恩 是121号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kane. It's number 121 .
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.33,1:11:15.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想看尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to see the body.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.59,1:11:18.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我老板可能会回来 不允许这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our boss could come back. We are not supposed to do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.88,1:11:21.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.77,1:11:39.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是这吗? 尸体去哪了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this it? I mean, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.74,1:11:41.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.07,1:11:43.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.32,1:11:45.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙来看那个美国人 但尸体不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy has come to see the American. But the body has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.03,1:11:47.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他兄弟他们昨晚来过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They came yesterday evening...his brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.99,1:11:49.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他没有登记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not in the register.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.54,1:11:51.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁? 怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.59,1:11:54.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这里面的尸体哪去了? - 我说过 昨晚有人来过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's the body that goes in here? - I said someone came last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.54,1:11:56.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们把尸体弄哪去了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. Where'd they take the body?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.25,1:11:58.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 这不是联欢会 明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, this is not a carnival, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.55,1:12:01.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都打电话预约 按规章办事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}PeopIe call, they make an appointment, follow the rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.42,1:12:04.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里进出都要登记 这儿很严肃 这的工作很严肃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone signs in and out. This is a serious place. Serious work.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.72,1:12:06.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是说你什么时候想来就来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not just to come in whenever you like!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.78,1:12:08.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说得对 我们进来时没有登记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. We didn't sign in.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.89,1:12:10.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,滚出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.10,1:12:13.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 很好 我马上就去登记 - 行了 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fine. I'm just gonna go sign in. - Okay, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.23,1:12:17.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是这个吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.27,1:12:19.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 慢点 - 你不能动登记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Slow down - You can't take the book. This is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.90,1:12:22.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的 这有铅笔 太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. There's a pencil in here. That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.65,1:12:25.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 你干嘛不去外面等着? 就它了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, why don't you go wait outside? Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.66,1:12:27.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't have... Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.92,1:12:32.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰森 刚才怎么回事? 你要找什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jason, what just happened in there? What are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.55,1:12:34.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼瓦纳·翁博希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nykwana Wombosi.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.42,1:12:37.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,翁博希去陈尸所看过凯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wombosi went to the morgue to visit Kane.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.30,1:12:39.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,明白了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.60,1:12:42.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 然后呢? - 听好 他也出现在联合保安的小册里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So? - He's in the Alliance brochure.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.06,1:12:44.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,同一人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.48,1:12:46.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他知道实情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy knows.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.51,1:13:23.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我法语很糟 我不能... 好象是说一艘船或...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My French sucks. I can't....It says something about a boat or....
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.52,1:13:28.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看不懂 报上说什么? 你看了 告诉我 怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand. What does it say? You read it. Tell me. What?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.15,1:13:35.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,报上说 翁博希在被杀前三周告诉警方...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It says that 3 weeks before he was killed, Mr. Wombosi told police...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.15,1:13:37.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一名男子在距马赛八公里的海上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that a man came onto his yacht,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.77,1:13:38.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爬上他的游艇...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}five miles off the coast of Marseilles...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.99,1:13:40.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并企图暗杀他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and tried to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.70,1:13:45.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,报上说 他把那人赶下了船 并击中他后背两枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It says that he chased the man off the boat and shot him twice in the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.62,1:13:48.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,报上说我是名刺客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It says I'm an assassin.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.33,1:14:30.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.21,1:14:33.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你说的是到...我们马上就到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But no...you said Rue de l... we're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.58,1:14:35.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就停这 这就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just right here, this is good.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.38,1:14:36.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,叫你停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.38,1:14:38.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.76,1:14:40.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.84,1:14:42.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你搞什么鬼?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.30,1:14:44.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 走 快走 - 怎么...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go. Go. - What are...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.22,1:14:45.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,钱给多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gave me too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.64,1:14:48.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们暴露了 快走 - 暴露? 暴什么露?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're blown. Come on. - Blown? What is ''blown''?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.93,1:14:51.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先生 找你零钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monsieur...your change, your change.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.10,1:14:54.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先生 你不能停这 你必须离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, please...You can't stay here... You have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.61,1:14:57.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,继续走 继续走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.40,1:15:00.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为他们会在那干嘛? 在监视饭店\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think they're doing there? They're on to the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.57,1:15:03.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不会 你不知道 - 相信我 继续走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. You don't know that. - Trust me. Just keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.30,1:15:27.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了? 你这是干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you crazy? What are you doing now?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.60,1:15:30.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰森!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jason!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.27,1:15:32.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是暴露\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is blown.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.28,1:15:42.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 玛丽? - 走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Marie? - Get away.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.44,1:15:44.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 玛丽 站住 - 离开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop right there. - Get away from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.74,1:15:46.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想怎样? 杀我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you gonna do? Kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.62,1:15:47.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 玛丽 - 下一步就杀我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Marie. - Is that next?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.99,1:15:50.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 镇静 镇静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, stay calm. Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.45,1:15:52.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管我们做什么都要一起做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever we do, we have to do it together.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.75,1:15:54.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们必须... - 我们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We have to be... - We?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.12,1:15:57.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有过的唯一共同之处就是我们都不知道你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only thing we had in common was that neither of us knew who you were.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.67,1:15:59.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已熬过来了 听我说!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've passed that now. Listen!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.50,1:16:03.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,警方会找我们的 在大使馆拿到照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The police'll find us. The people who took the picture in the embassy...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.01,1:16:06.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杀死翁博希的那帮人就要来追杀我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who killed Wombosi, they're gonna come here and kill us.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.09,1:16:07.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也在为那帮人干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people who you work for.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.64,1:16:13.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会带你去你该去的任何地方 我会带你去 我会让你在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will take you wherever you need to go. I'll take you there. I'll leave you there.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.93,1:16:16.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你愿做什么就做什么 永远别再见我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can do what you want. You never have to see me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.69,1:16:19.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但在这不行 我们留在这就死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not here. If we stay here, we die.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.36,1:16:30.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老天 这些警察真是干得"太棒了"!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy, great police work! Really brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.66,1:16:34.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛不在那挂幅标语 写上"别回来! "\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't they just hang out a banner that says, ''Don't come back! ''
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.50,1:16:39.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天! 法语怎么说"监控"二字?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ! What is the French word for ''stakeout''?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.80,1:16:49.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这事发生在16分钟前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, this was 16 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.01,1:16:52.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就从这开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is our starting point.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.35,1:16:55.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们不能乘飞机火车 妮基? - 我在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can't fly, trains are risky. Nicky? - Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.98,1:16:59.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要知道巴黎那些出色警察的一举一动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to know everything Paris's finest is doing on this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.52,1:17:00.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.02,1:17:04.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说过24小时 但他并没回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said 24 hours, and he's not back.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.24,1:17:09.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们很清楚他现在在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. But we got a good idea where he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.74,1:17:12.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的这个秘密特工疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got a black ops agent who's off the reservation.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.58,1:17:15.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他把美国领事馆毁得一塌糊涂 如今又在欧洲四处逃命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He trashed an American consulate. He's on the run in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.79,1:17:18.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而你还不知原因何在 但我却面对监察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know why. I got to stand before an oversight committee.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.09,1:17:20.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,关于踩石行动 我对他们说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What will I say about Treadstone?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.75,1:17:23.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你担心的是预算会议吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're worried about a budget meeting?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.26,1:17:26.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不负责此事 这事处理不好就难堪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't take care of this, we don't make it to the men's room.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.09,1:17:29.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在明白了吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, is that clear enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.76,1:17:31.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会毁在这事上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will burn for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.43,1:17:34.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们两个都会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will both of us burn.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.06,1:17:39.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 分两个组 达尔 雷继续监视电脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I want two teams. Daryl, Ray, stay on the grids.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.11,1:17:42.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,布菜恩 哈里斯 史蒂夫...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brian, Harris, Steve...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.44,1:17:44.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你们追查那个姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I want to work on this girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.32,1:17:47.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 住宅图样进行得怎样? - 已开始做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And this residency pattern? - We started it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.49,1:17:48.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.68,1:17:55.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,参照了她祖母和她同父异母弟弟的号码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cross-referenced numbers from the grandmother and the stepbrother.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.68,1:17:57.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们发现有重合时 就提取号码...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we found convergence, we took the numbers...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.90,1:17:59.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,往回查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...back-checked them,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.11,1:18:02.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,结合手头资料一起搜索 虽然线索有限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ran a search merge with other data we had, which wasn't much.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.15,1:18:03.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看这些图钉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pins. These pins.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.73,1:18:07.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些就是她过去六年住过的所有地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are all the places we think she's lived in the last six years.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.57,1:18:10.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一 二 三 四 五处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, two, three, four, five.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.73,1:18:11.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我们的资料库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's our pool.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.67,1:18:19.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没人接听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.71,1:18:21.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你让铃声响了几下?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many times you let it ring?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.09,1:18:25.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你要不想去 我就搭便车 - 我说过送你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look, if you don't want to go, I'll hitch. - I said I'd take you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.68,1:18:29.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些就是目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are the targets.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.13,1:18:34.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恳求 讨借 黑客 窃听 迂回 我不在乎你们用何种手段!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beg, borrow, hack, tap, bypass! I don't care what you do!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.55,1:18:37.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只要你们告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to know everything you can tell me
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.61,1:18:39.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些地方发生的所有事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about what's going on at those locations.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.07,1:19:00.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道这房子仍是他的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know he still owns this?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.62,1:19:04.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,埃蒙总是有钱 他不会卖的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eamon always had money. He would never sell this.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.82,1:19:36.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marie?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.03,1:19:37.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.95,1:19:40.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.28,1:19:42.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.49,1:19:43.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.16,1:19:48.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为这儿会...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it would....
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.25,1:19:57.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 见鬼 是埃蒙 我跟他说 - 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shit, that's Eamon. I'll talk to him. - We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.18,1:20:03.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,埃蒙 意外吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eamon. Surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.01,1:20:07.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我 玛丽 哦 老天...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me, Marie. Wow, God...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.06,1:20:10.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来这真是对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...there's a really good reason for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.44,1:20:12.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,理由太充分了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There bloody well better be.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.10,1:20:14.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 爸爸? - 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Daddy! - Hang on. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.98,1:20:19.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没想到你会在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had no idea you would be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.90,1:20:22.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么会在这? 这是我唯一的房子 没错吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, why would I be here? It's only my bloody house, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.82,1:20:24.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.12,1:20:27.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她带你来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did she get you into this?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.62,1:20:31.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只准备呆一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was just gonna be for a day.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.37,1:20:34.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸 阿兰要撒尿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy, Alain has to go pee!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.88,1:20:37.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 来吧 下车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, all right, come on. Here. Get out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.21,1:20:40.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 你进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, in you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.92,1:20:42.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,过来 阿兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Alain.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.93,1:20:45.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. l....
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.26,1:20:48.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为会没事的 但我想我错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it would be okay. But I guess I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.10,1:20:49.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我要找妈妈 - 妈妈?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's find Mommy. - Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.06,1:20:52.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈在外面要呆两天 幸好这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy is away for two days, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.15,1:20:59.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你把自己缠上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got yourseIf all tied up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.23,1:21:00.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.66,1:21:06.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他做什么的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he do for a living?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.58,1:21:09.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以前做航运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He used to be in shipping.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.08,1:21:13.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他适合你吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he good for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.00,1:21:15.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你幸福吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you happy?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.92,1:21:18.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我的 我在努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know me. I try too hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.49,1:21:42.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.74,1:21:45.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,睡个好觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sleep well.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.20,1:21:46.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.41,1:21:50.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我睡地板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll sleep on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.76,1:21:59.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是几点的事情? - 早上11点45\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This was when? - 11:45 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.26,1:22:01.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,完全在从巴黎开车所及的范围之内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is definitely within the driving range of Paris.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.76,1:22:05.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,电话是从公路南側的路边休息店打的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The call came from a highway rest stop, southbound side.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.77,1:22:07.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 这个黄图钉代表什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. What's this yellow pin?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.35,1:22:09.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她1997年在那里呆了几个月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She spent two months there in 1997.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.56,1:22:11.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,距离最近的镇子是里奥姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Closest town is Riom.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.36,1:22:16.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从她家的电话记录把国际电话整理出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We took her family's phone records and collated the international calls.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.86,1:22:18.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们凌晨两点时在巴黎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were in Paris at 2.:00 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.86,1:22:21.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们无法乘飞机 火车也太危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can't fly. The train's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.78,1:22:24.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他太知道我们会去哪追捕他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows better than to go anywhere we might track him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.91,1:22:26.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只能这样猜测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this is our best guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.93,1:23:29.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在这干嘛? - 看孩子 我担心睡不着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing? - The kids. I was worried. I couldn't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.14,1:23:31.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会弄醒他们的 我们得离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll wake them up. We got to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.43,1:23:33.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不想知道自己是谁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to know who I am anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.64,1:23:36.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎 我不想知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care. I don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.94,1:23:42.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 过来，我们谈一谈… - 我查明的任何事 我都想忘记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. We'll talk about... - Everything I find out I want to forget.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.03,1:23:44.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.91,1:23:47.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎我是谁 或干过什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care who I am or what I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.48,1:23:49.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.81,1:23:51.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have this money.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.56,1:23:54.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可以藏起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can hide.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.57,1:23:59.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能这样做吗? 你有可能这样做吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we do that? Is there any chance you can do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.37,1:24:08.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.54,1:24:15.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.01,1:24:28.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乖狗 出来! 出来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, boy! Here, boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.72,1:24:30.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.31,1:24:32.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老天 你起得够早的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christ. You were up early.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.02,1:24:34.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你煮的咖啡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bless you for making coffee.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.36,1:24:45.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就一宿 你们没开玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One night. You weren't kidding.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.33,1:24:47.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,换换环境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a change.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.24,1:24:50.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他也不在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not there either.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.88,1:24:53.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 车的旁边找了吗? - 到处都找不到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And you looked by the car? - He's not anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.68,1:24:56.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我们穿衣服吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let me get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.51,1:24:59.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谁? - 狗不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who? - Bloody dog's gone missing.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.18,1:25:00.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这事经常发生吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does that happen a lot?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.85,1:25:03.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么? 那狗? 早上不吃就跑? 从不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? That mutt? Miss his breakfast? Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.39,1:25:05.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,总是有原因的 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's always something, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.56,1:25:09.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快去地下室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.48,1:25:10.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.23,1:25:14.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快带他们进地下室 - 你在说些什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get everyone in the basement right now. - What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.74,1:25:18.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你和你家人有危险 我没时间解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in danger. Your family's in danger. I don't have time to explain.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.24,1:25:20.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 等等 究竟... - 埃蒙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait a minute. What... - Eamon.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.33,1:25:21.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们应该走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should go.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.74,1:25:24.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你究竟干了什么? - 不是她 是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What have you done? - It's not her. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.50,1:25:28.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们必须尽快下地下室去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to get out of sight and in the basement as quick as you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.38,1:25:29.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.84,1:25:36.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.26,1:25:37.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.36,1:25:58.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 电话没声 - 知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The phone is dead. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.62,1:26:02.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰森 外面是什么人? 是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jason, who's out there? Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.59,1:26:21.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.80,1:26:22.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.14,1:26:30.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们根本不该来这 我...两个孩子...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should never have come here. l.... These children....
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.48,1:26:32.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.80,1:29:02.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在哪? 武器在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it? Where's the weapon?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.30,1:29:09.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有谁在? 还有谁? 你们有几个人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who else is out here? Who else? How many you got with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.47,1:29:11.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再问第二遍的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna ask you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.97,1:29:14.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我单干 和你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I work alone. Like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.48,1:29:18.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们总是单干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We always work alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.90,1:29:21.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这话什么意思? - 你是哪儿的? 罗马?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you mean? - Who are you? Rome?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.32,1:29:22.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还是巴黎?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paris?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.82,1:29:26.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们两个都参加踩石行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Treadstone, both of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.61,1:29:28.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 踩石? - 是哪的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Treadstone? - Which one?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.32,1:29:30.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,巴黎 我住在巴黎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paris. I live in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.08,1:29:31.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你头疼吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get the headaches?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.87,1:29:33.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.70,1:29:35.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我头疼得厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get such bad headaches.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.08,1:29:38.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道晚上开车的感觉吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know at night when you're driving a car?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.54,1:29:40.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许和开前灯有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it's the headlights.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.34,1:29:42.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,踩石是什么东西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is Treadstone?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.17,1:29:45.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,踩石行动意味着止疼药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Treadstone said pills.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.13,1:29:49.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们叫我们去巴黎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They said go to Paris.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.22,1:29:51.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,踩石在巴黎?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Treadstone in Paris?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.52,1:29:55.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.35,1:29:59.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧他们都让你付出了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at what they make you give.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.26,1:30:26.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.26,1:30:29.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克劳迪娅 你坐前面并系上安全带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Claudia, get in the front and put your beIt on.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.05,1:30:31.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我把你放在后座\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, we're gonna put you in the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.39,1:30:33.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克劳迪娅 坐前面去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}AII right, get in the front, Claudia.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.89,1:30:41.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽 我不再等了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not waiting, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.19,1:30:43.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,埃蒙 再等一等 不等了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One minute, Eamon. I'm not waiting!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.07,1:30:44.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,求你了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.78,1:30:46.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.07,1:30:49.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我取出了三万美金 其余都归你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took out $30, 000. The rest is yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.45,1:30:52.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就这样? - 我就这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's it? - That's all I got.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.37,1:30:56.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是这意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.91,1:31:01.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽 不能再拖了 你必须现在就走 离开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not gonna stop, Marie. You got to get out now. Away from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.92,1:31:05.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须离开 赶快逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to get out. You got to start running.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.96,1:31:07.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要隐藏行踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get low, you stay low.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.76,1:31:09.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要再交朋友 要换新环境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more friends. Nothing familiar.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.18,1:31:15.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里的钱够你生活 什么生活都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's enough in there for you to make a life. Any life.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.97,1:31:17.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽 我要走了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm out of here, Marie!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.43,1:31:18.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.10,1:31:23.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快上车 你必须走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in the car. You got to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.07,1:31:31.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你打算怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.78,1:31:33.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把它了结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll end it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.78,1:31:35.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.74,1:31:38.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.37,1:32:58.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请报代号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Code in, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.99,1:33:00.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,报代号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Code in.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.54,1:33:05.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,报代号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Code in.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.05,1:33:11.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是哪位?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.26,1:33:19.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.73,1:33:24.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你派来的人已死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man you sent is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.56,1:33:27.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以不管你是谁 你最好开口说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So whoever this is, you better start talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.73,1:33:29.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 杰森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Jason.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.23,1:33:33.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你看现在怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what are we into now?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.66,1:33:42.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有两个办法 要么回来处理好这事...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It only goes two ways. Either you come in and let us make this right...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.20,1:33:44.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要么只好继续玩下去 直到我们满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or we'll keep going until we're satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.46,1:33:46.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说 直到我死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean until you kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.08,1:33:50.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道问题所在 我没法补救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't fix this if I don't know what the problem is.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.92,1:33:53.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我怎么做 我会尽力而为的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me what we're into, and I'll do the best I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.60,1:34:04.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰森 你干嘛不和玛丽谈一谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you talk to Marie, Jason?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.81,1:34:09.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 问问玛丽她的想法是什么 - 说实话 我想她才不在乎呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's ask Marie what she wants. - I don't think she gives a shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.48,1:34:11.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.32,1:34:22.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真遗憾 是怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry to hear that. How did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.95,1:34:25.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她拖我后腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was sIowing me down.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.12,1:34:29.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 杰森 我们做这些是...- 够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All we've been doing right from... - Enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.23,1:34:30.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.46,1:34:33.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今天下午五点半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}5:30 p.m. Paris.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.97,1:34:35.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在巴黎新桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today. Pont Neuf.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.97,1:34:38.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就自己来 走到桥中间位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come alone, you walk to the middle of that bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.51,1:34:40.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,脱下外套 面朝东方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take off your jacket. Face east.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.64,1:34:42.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我会再拨这个号码 - 等等!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll redial this number. - Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.82,1:34:56.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坐头班飞机去 告诉妮基我会在车上 给她打电话 叫她找"花边" \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First flight out. Tell Nicky I'll call from the car. Tell her to find Picot.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.00,1:34:57.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.20,1:35:01.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那好...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So....
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.16,1:35:03.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们打算怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.83,1:35:06.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过我会把它摆平 我正在做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you I'dclean this up. That's what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.21,1:35:07.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真能把他带回来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you really bring him in?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.83,1:35:10.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这事我们不是已说过了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we're past that, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.34,1:35:13.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么高见?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have a better idea?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.01,1:35:15.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除了从苏黎世到巴黎的一连串破坏...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've given me nothing but a trail of collateral damage...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.84,1:35:18.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你什么都没干 换我来干肯定比这好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...from Zurich to Paris. I couldn't do much worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.30,1:35:21.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛不上楼去订一个会议室?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you go upstairs and book a conference room?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.18,1:35:23.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你能说得他俯首听命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you can talk him to death.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.59,1:36:43.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大巴 观光大巴 顶层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bus, the tour bus, second level.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.26,1:36:47.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,于目标无碍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Negative on the target.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.64,1:36:51.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 一号位置? - 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Position one? - Negative.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.94,1:36:54.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 二号位置 - 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Position two? - Negative.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.12,1:37:11.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三号位置 摩托车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Position three, motorcycle.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.75,1:37:14.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Negative.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.66,1:37:40.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰森?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jason?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.45,1:37:44.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫你独自来 我猜这对你太难办了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you to come alone. I guess that was too complicated.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.50,1:37:46.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就试试这个吧:我走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So try this: I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.80,1:37:51.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.64,1:38:00.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,接通妮基的电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get Nicky on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.28,1:38:17.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.20,1:38:19.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把房间清理好要多长时间?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long to wipe down the room and move it?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.83,1:38:21.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 处理掉所有资料? - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get rid of everything? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.50,1:38:25.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 两到三个小时 - 那好 马上干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Two to three hours. - All right, get started.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.38,1:38:33.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,中间别停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, no breaks.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.80,1:38:36.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两人守外面 一人在大厅 要警惕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two men outside, one in the lobby. And keep your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.72,1:38:41.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 卡车留下? - 对 留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Keep the truck? - Keep the truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.81,1:38:44.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要关掉这个小组 把设备搬到车上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna close this unit down. We'll move the gear in the truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.16,1:39:04.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们负责西班牙 马耳他和摩洛哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were covering Spain, Malta, Morocco.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.00,1:39:07.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 当地警方的所有无线信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, all local police radio traffic.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.67,1:39:11.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 动北欧需要总部授权 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, for northern Europe we need an authorized directive. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.34,1:39:15.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 他们开始干了 我们半小时后收到卫星下传资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, they're on it. We'll have a satellite download in 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.95,1:40:26.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的行动箱在哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's your field box?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.87,1:40:34.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你的行动箱在哪? - 就在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's your field box? - It's right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.12,1:40:37.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,整个系统出故障了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole system's gone haywire.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.13,1:40:40.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,问题就在这边的这个窗户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's this window right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.88,1:40:42.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,餐厅窗户呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dining room window?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.14,1:40:45.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我搞不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.81,1:40:49.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没信号 电话没信号了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead. The phones are dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.81,1:40:53.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伯恩干的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Bourne, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.31,1:40:55.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别出声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.24,1:41:45.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你动就死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You move, you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.53,1:41:46.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伯恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourne.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.91,1:41:48.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,枪扔了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gun down.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.25,1:41:55.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In there.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.04,1:41:58.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 你想干...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so what do you want...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.92,1:42:00.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,踩石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Treadstone.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.88,1:42:03.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好看看周围 没剩下什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better take a look around. There's not much left.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.47,1:42:06.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你就是踩石? - 我是踩石? 我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you Treadstone? - Am I Treadstone? Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.05,1:42:08.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么鬼话?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.14,1:42:09.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's lost it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.81,1:42:11.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好马上解释清楚!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better start filling in the blanks here!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.70,1:42:14.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我还以为 我们是一边的呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause I thought we were on the same side.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.10,1:42:15.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哪边?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whose side is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.48,1:42:19.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道自己都在干什么吗? 你什么都不明白!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know what you're doing, do you? You don't have a goddamn clue!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.82,1:42:21.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.23,1:42:23.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是美国政府的资产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're U.S. government property!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.28,1:42:26.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是身价三千万 但却出岔子的一件武器!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a malfunctioning $30 million weapon!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.78,1:42:28.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你十足是一个祸害!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a total goddamn catastrophe!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.82,1:42:31.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看在老天的份上 你就是杀我也得告诉我 究竟出什么事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, by God, if it kilIs me, you'll tell me how this happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.99,1:42:35.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你为何想要杀我? - 马赛那边出什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why are you trying to kill me? - What happened in Marseilles?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.04,1:42:37.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你派我去杀翁博希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sent me to kill Wombosi.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.00,1:42:41.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杀翁博希? 没错 这事我们随时都能做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill Wombosi? Yeah, we can do that any time we want.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.13,1:42:43.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以派妮基去做这事 真见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can send Nicky to do that, for Christ's sake.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.76,1:42:46.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,翁博希本该在三周前就死掉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Wombosi was supposed to be dead three weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.63,1:42:50.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的死本该只有一种解释 那就是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was supposed to have died in a way that the only possible explanation was...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.76,1:42:53.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是被自己的一名随从谋杀的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that he'd been murdered by a member of his own entourage.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.85,1:42:55.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会派你去暗杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't send you to kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.77,1:42:57.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我派你躲藏起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I send you to be invisible.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.48,1:42:59.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我派你 是因为你这人根本就不存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I send you because you don't exist.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.94,1:43:02.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道在马赛出什么事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to know what happened in Marseilles.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.15,1:43:05.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不记得在马赛发生什么事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't remember what happened in Marseilles.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.19,1:43:07.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瞎扯! 战士 这不可接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullshit! This is unacceptable, soldier.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.95,1:43:09.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听见了吗? 你失手了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hear me? You failed!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.70,1:43:11.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不可接受? 你失手了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unacceptable? You failed!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.28,1:43:15.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你失手了 所以你要告诉我原因! - 我没法告诉你! 我记不起来了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You failed and you're gonna tell me why! - I can't tell you! I don't remember!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.16,1:43:18.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你激活了凯恩 你安排了与翁博希的见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You brought Kane to life. You put together a meeting with Wombosi.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.33,1:43:21.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你找到了保安公司 你闯了进去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You found the security company. You broke into the office!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.21,1:43:25.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼 你挑选游艇作为下手地点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Christ's sake, you picked the yacht as the goddamn strike point!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.72,1:43:34.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你选了游艇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You picked the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.27,1:43:37.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你选了日子 你跟踪船员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You picked the day. You tracked the crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.14,1:43:38.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,食物 燃料!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The food, the fuel!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.81,1:43:41.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你把地点 时间告诉了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You told us where. You told us when.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.15,1:43:44.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在那船上藏了五天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hid out on that boat five days.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.82,1:43:47.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你参与了 杰森 你参与了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were in, Jason. You were in!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.49,1:43:49.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它结束了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was over!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.63,1:44:51.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 你记得的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you do remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.43,1:44:55.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.06,1:45:04.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想再干这个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to do this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.31,1:45:07.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想这不是你能决定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think that's a decision you can make.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.16,1:45:15.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰森·伯恩死了 听见了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jason Bourne is dead. Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.83,1:45:17.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他两周前淹死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He drowned two weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.66,1:45:20.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要告诉他们伯恩死了 明白吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna go tell them Bourne is dead. Understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.58,1:45:22.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你打算去哪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you gonna go?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.04,1:45:25.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓 只要我觉得有人跟踪我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear, if I even feel somebody behind me,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.40,1:45:26.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就会不顾一切地...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there is no measure to how fast...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.17,1:45:30.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把战火烧到你家门口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and how hard I will bring this fight to your doorstep.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.30,1:45:32.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在是自己一边了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on my own side now.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.01,1:49:08.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,干掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's done.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.81,1:49:10.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把它关掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.60,1:49:51.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,踩石行动项目实际上已被终止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Treadstone project has already been terminated.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.52,1:49:54.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,本是想把它设计成一种高级行动方案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was designed primarily as a sort of advanced game program.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.81,1:49:57.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希望能把它变成一个出色的训练平台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd hoped it might build into a good training platform.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.61,1:50:01.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说实话 对一项纯理论训练而言...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But quite honestly, for a strictly theoretical exercise...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.28,1:50:03.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个代价也太高了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the cost-benefit ratio was just too high.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.70,1:50:05.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该项目到此被全部取消\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all but decommissioned at this point.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.87,1:50:07.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 下面是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, what's next?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.53,1:50:09.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 这是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, this is...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.50,1:50:12.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,黑荆棘项目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Blackbriar.
